ot all is lost. You will retain your upgraded and updated deck of cards when you embark on a new run! <br> <br>Your hand is made up of two types of cards: <strong>Clubs</strong>\u2663\ufe0f and <strong>Diamonds\u2666\ufe0f</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clubs</strong>\u2663\ufe0fare scoring cards as their values are added to the total score directly. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diamonds\u2666\ufe0f</strong>cards, on the other, hand affect cards to their right- triggering compounding effect. Be sure to reorder cards to maximize their impact, trigger synergies and score big.\u00a0 </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/extras/51545b7174f2fb5cf0577d0c52812019.poster.avif?t=1769032356\" width=1170 height=758 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/extras/51545b7174f2fb5cf0577d0c52812019.webm?t=1769032356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/extras/51545b7174f2fb5cf0577d0c52812019.mp4?t=1769032356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more cards you play the more cash you earn. The more risk you take the more you score. But you also risk losing it all. The best strategy is the one that works.\u00a0</p>","developers":["POi interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/fa4515113c92b85f310f0e829da8c4af74417549/header.jpg?t=1769032356","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<st